<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  /* Basic styling to mimic document structure */
  body { font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; }
  h1, h2, h3 { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0.5em; }
  .header-info { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .section { margin-bottom: 25px; }
  .form-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .form-label { flex-basis: 30%; }
  .form-input { flex-basis: 65%; border-bottom: 1px solid #000; }
  .table-container { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 15px; }
  .table-container td { padding: 5px 0; }
  .signature-line { margin-top: 60px; }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-info">
    <img src="logo_placeholder.png" alt="Logo" style="height: 60px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
    <h1>NORTH CAROLINA AGRICULTURAL AND TECHNICAL STATE UNIVERSITY</h1>
    <h2>Event Ticket Request Form</h2>
    <p>University Box Office</p>
    <p>Ticket Office-Brown Hall North Carolina A&T State</p>
    <p>University Telephone: {{ university_phone }} | Fax: {{ university_fax }}</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <p>This form is for departments and/or student organizations requesting ticket office support for any campus activities. This form must be submitted to University Event Center no less than 21 days prior to the event date.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h3>Ticketing Request Details</h3>
    <p>The University Logistics Committee will make the final decision on required ticketed admission, ticket stock, andthe number of tickets available to be printed and sold based on program content, facility, event set-up, facility capacity and the number of program participants.</p>

    <div class="form-row">
      <div class="form-label">Contact Name:</div>
      <div class="form-input">{{ contact_name }}</div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-row">
      <div class="form-label">Contact Number:</div>
      <div class="form-input">{{ contact_number }}</div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-row">
      <div class="form-label">Event Reference #:</div>
      <div class="form-input">{{ event_reference }}</div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-row">
      <div class="form-label">Fund Account Name:</div>
      <div class="form-input">{{ fund_account_name }}</div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-row">
      <div class="form-label">Fund Account Number:</div>
      <div class="form-input">{{ fund_account_number }}</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <p>(Student Organization funds will be deposited in COSA)</p>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div class="form-label">Distribution Date:</div>
      <div class="form-input">{{ distribution_date }}</div>
      <div class="form-label" style="flex-basis: 20%;">Number of tickets requested:</div>
      <div class="form-input" style="flex-basis: 30%;">{{ total_tickets_requested }}</div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-row">
      <div class="form-label">Total # of Complimentary tickets:</div>
      <div class="form-input">{{ complimentary_tickets }}</div>
      <div style="flex-basis: 65%; display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
        <label><input type="checkbox"> Yes</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox"> No</label>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p>Would you like to check these tickets out on consignment?</p>
    <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Pre-Sale</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Door Sales</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Both</label>
    </div>

    <div class="form-row">
      <div class="form-label">Total # of consignment tickets:</div>
      <div class="form-input">{{ consignment_tickets }}</div>
    </div>
    <p style="font-size: 0.8em; margin-top: 5px;">*A cost estimate associated with police coverage will be used upon completion of this form. There is also a 3% commission fee on all tickets sold for all non-campus organizations requesting a ticketed event, as well as a $0.25 charge for each ticket printed.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h3>Your ticket will include the following information</h3>
    <table class="table-container">
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 20%;"> (1) Sponsoring Organization:</td>
        <td style="width: 80%;"><span data-field="sponsoring_organization">{{ sponsoring_organization }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td> (2) Event Name:</td>
        <td><span data-field="event_name">{{ event_name }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td> (3) Date & Time:</td>
        <td><span data-field="date_time">{{ date_time }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td> (5) Location:</td>
        <td><span data-field="location">{{ location }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 15%;"> (6) Price:</td>
        <td style="width: 40%;">College Student ID-Cost: $ <span data-field="price_student_id">{{ price_student_id }}</span> x 10% = Ticket Price: $ <span data-field="price_student_final">{{ price_student_final }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td></td>
        <td>Day of Show Cost: $ <span data-field="price_day_of_show">{{ price_day_of_show }}</span> x 10% = Ticket Price: $ <span data-field="price_day_of_show_final">{{ price_day_of_show_final }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td></td>
        <td>General Public Cost: $ <span data-field="price_general_public">{{ price_general_public }}</span> x 10% = Ticket Price: $ <span data-field="price_general_public_final">{{ price_general_public_final }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td></td>
        <td>Day of Show Cost: $ <span data-field="price_day_of_show_2">{{ price_day_of_show_2 }}</span> x 10% = Ticket Price: $ <span data-field="price_day_of_show_2_final">{{ price_day_of_show_2_final }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <p>Please describe any additional ticket distribution or packaging information:</p>
    <div style="border: 1px solid #000; height: 100px; padding: 10px;">
      <span data-field="additional_notes">{{ additional_notes }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="signature-line">
    <p>Signature:</p>
    <div style="border-top: 1px solid #000; width: 300px; margin-top: 50px;"></div>
    <p style="margin-top: 5px;">{{ signatory_name }}</p>
  </div>

  <div style="text-align: center; font-size: 0.7em; margin-top: 50px;">
    <p>A Land-Grant University and A Constituent Institution of the University of North Carolina Student Center, Suite 368 #1403 W. John Mitchell Dr @ Greensboro, NC 27411 (336) 285-2580 • Fax (336) 334-7131</p>
  </div>
</div>